{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act53side_level_act53side_04_end","storyGroup":"act53side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act53side_level_act53side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TO-4","storyName":"谷里升起太阳","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"仍在向太阳谷工业争取维修机会的阿梅利亚和嘉辛塔突然收到了安洁莉娜带来的紧急消息——单独下井找人的塔妮遭遇了突发事件，急需帮助！","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act53side/level_act53side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act53side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["塔妮","悠闲的矿工","安洁莉娜","太阳谷维修员","阿梅利亚","严肃的负责人","太阳谷联络员","嘉辛塔"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_bg_76_g5_sunvalleycom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_farce_n_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2","text":"","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"欸？下井了？可这几天不是没有采掘任务吗？","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#2$1","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"就是因为没有采掘任务才得她下井啊。她下的不是矿井，是我们内部通讯系统使用的管线井。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"前一阵子我们都改用纵贯红土公司的无线系统了，结果大断连一来，又得把旧设备从仓库里搬出来。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"旧系统已经好多年了，一段时间不用之后全是毛病，她就是下井解决那些陈年老毛病去了。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2","text":"","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"那您能告诉我她是从哪里下去，又要去哪里吗？","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#2$1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"可以是可以，但你下过矿吗？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2","text":"","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我叔叔巴尼特就在矿井工作，我小时候他带我下去过几次。我只是找个人而已，不会多逗留的......","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2","text":"","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"......您要来颗胡萝卜糖吗？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#2$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"噗，你这小姑娘，当我多大，要用糖收买我？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-70,0","duration":"0.8","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嘿嘿......","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2","posfrom":"-70,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#2$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"......啧啧，这胡萝卜糖口味真不错。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"反正那个维修员也没下多深，就是里面的路不好认，我七八岁的时候就天天往里钻了。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"看见那边的入口了吗？这个图上画红叉的地方就是她检修的位置。记得快进快出。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"顺便，这对讲机你也拿着，是用旧的内部通讯系统的。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2","text":"","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我自己有通讯装置——","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#2$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悠闲的矿工","text":"就连纵贯红土公司的设备也得为太阳谷特地做信号增强，你们自己的通讯装置在井下不顶用的。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#17$2","text":"","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"谢谢你！","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-17$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_46_g6_rmbtmine.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"80,0","text":"","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"喂喂，安洁莉娜，能听到我说话吗？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":56},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":57},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_square_common","char":"安洁莉娜","switch":"true","style":"1","offset":"-450,125","channel":"3","id":58},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"-400,-20","pto":"-400,-20","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","duration":"0","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"可以可以，信号稳定！","id":61},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我已经知道去旧系统基站要怎么走了，你放心，那条路很安全！在上面等我的好消息吧！","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":65},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"好，每隔五分钟我会呼叫你一次，记得和我保持通讯！","id":67},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"没问题～","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":72},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","tsto":"0,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#4$3","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"呼——","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-4$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"你能做到的，塔妮！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":81},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"7","xstrength":"0","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"2","randomness":"3","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":82},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"1","id":83},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"bg_cave_5","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1.13","yScaleTo":"1.13","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-30","duration":"4","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"十米，二十米，塔妮打着晃晃悠悠的头灯，独自往漆黑一片的通道深处走去。","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"唔，还挺顺利的嘛。","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"就是下面真的好黑哦......我得小心一点，别踩空了......","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":90},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":91},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sandfall_01","layer":"1","id":94},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.3","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"——！","id":97},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":102},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_50_g17_wunderpass.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":103},{"type":"charslot","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":106,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"......终于把线接上了。接下来只要通电测试没问题就可以收工了。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"说起来，这地方怎么有点眼熟......既视感？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"嗯......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"......原来是这里啊。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"唉，没关系的。这都多少年了，他们肯定早都已经把薄弱处补好了......","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":114},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":115},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"塌方？！","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":120},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sandfall_01","layer":"1","id":121},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.3","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-150","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"呃啊......我的胳膊！","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"verticalslider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.35","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":131},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.35","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"verticalslider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"0030呼叫总部，0030呼叫总部......","id":136},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"糟了，我......","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"我该怎么办......","id":141},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"charslot","id":145},{"type":"curtain","id":146},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_bg_76_g5_sunvalleycom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":149},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"喂喂，塔妮？五分钟到了，你现在怎么样？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"塔妮？塔妮？能听到我说话吗？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$2","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"坏了——！","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-17$2.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":164},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_bg_offce.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":172},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$sjoyasorrow_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_sjoyasorrow_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":173,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#7$1","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"先先先生您看，这一大包都是我的通讯核心，您看我把它们保护得多好，这些真的都是我接下来一路维修要用的！","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#8$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"您也是通讯塔的负责人，肯定能看出来这些东西不是我拿来骗人的，我......我真的是来维修信号塔的工程师！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"我说了，这些无法证明您的身份。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#12$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"（小声）不行不行不行绝对不能在这里就停下我要不直接去按他们的火警警报然后趁他们慌乱的时候偷溜进去？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"（小声）没错这样我偷跑进去一定就能争取到维修的机会——","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#8$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"（小声）别胡闹！现在重要的是身份！你身上到底有没有什么东西可以证明身份？","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#7$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"（小声）我真的只有这些......","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#8$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"（小声）那现在连我都要起疑了！你们到底——","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"对了！巴顿先生！","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"怎么了？","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"我叫嘉辛塔·坎贝尔，我在太阳谷也有股份——我可以以我的股东身份担保，让阿梅利亚来维修通讯塔吗？","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"......身份欺诈是很严重的犯罪，小姐。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#9$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"我知道我的股份在太阳谷不算什么，但米娅和利亚姆·坎贝尔难道您也没听说过？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"恰恰相反，他们太有名了，每个想招摇撞骗的人都试图和他们扯上关系。我们可不知道自己有个叫嘉辛塔的股东。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"不、不知道吗？","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#5$1","posfrom":"250,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.8","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"（小声）既然打算骗人就装得强硬一点啊！突然软了下来就没气势了！","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"不，我没在骗人！","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"您可以去股东名册里找！我的名字一定在那里面！","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"text","text":"负责人狐疑地看着嘉辛塔，但眼前这个小姑娘实在过于郑重其事了。","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"唔，还真的有。嘉辛塔·坎贝尔，照片看起来还是个小朋友，但......她长大了的确应该是你的样子。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#9$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"呼......","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"我在如释重负个什么劲啊，真是的......算了，巴顿先生，这样是不是可以让阿梅利亚去修塔了？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"......这件事我得和其他人商量一下。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"不管怎么说，我对刚刚的轻慢感到抱歉。二位可以在矿区住一段时间，等我们得出结论再行动。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"住一段时间？得出结论要这么久吗？","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"因为这同样涉及我们在大铁屯和纵贯红土公司交涉的部分，现在远程通讯中断，信使来往需要时间。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#5$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"这就难办了，和我们同行的安洁莉娜小姐——","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#8$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"绝绝绝绝绝绝对不行！我们现在就去修塔好不好，嘉辛塔——巴顿先生！","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"呃......这、这么急吗？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"真的很急——而且安洁莉娜也很急啊！","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"可现在最急的好像是你啊。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我......","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#14$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我确实很急，我没法不急——我其实是背着公司跑出来的啊！","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"欸？！","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我......我之前一直没跟你们讲，怕你们——","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#16$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"替我担心——","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#6$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"——其实纵贯红土公司的工程总监本来也不是现场技术人员，而是研发人员，所以我没有工程师的证明！","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"研发人员的证明你总该有吧？","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":256},{"type":"charslot","id":257},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_victorianormal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":258,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"在、在这里！这是我的工牌，名字和工号都在上面！","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#4$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"（小声）......你刚刚不是说只有那些工具能证明身份吗？那现在这个算什么？","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"（小声）非......非常抱歉！刚刚我一急，说有袋鼷兽把纸质文件偷走了，又拿出一个不完全匹配的工牌，我怕会......","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"（小声）你这家伙急中生智的本领倒是不差......等塔修完，有没有兴趣跟我去萨尔贡做生意？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"（小声）萨、萨尔贡？联络员先生您别打岔，我快要乱套了啊啊啊......","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"（小声）好好好。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#3$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"80,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"和来安装的那些人的工牌倒确实是一套，颜色也不一样......看着倒是那么回事。不过你们公司的工牌都不写职位的？","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#12$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"公司、公司推崇扁平化管理，所以......","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"行吧。所以这一切到底是怎么回事，阿梅利亚小姐？","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我......我，负责了远程通讯系统的研发，顺利投入运营，可上面还是觉得收支不平衡，希望能进一步削减开支！","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"所以我又迭代了全自动的二代系统！可、可我的同事......呃，阿什顿先生，他工作实在太粗心了！","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#17$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"他提交给我的数据中有不少错误，测试也不好好跑，大家又都着急，二代系统就风风火火地上了线......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"结果导致了大断连，公司非要我负责不可，又是赔偿又是担责，可这明明就不是我的错呀！","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"纵贯红土公司......哥伦比亚起家的企业果然多多少少都有点这方面的问题。我们雷姆必拓的企业从来不做这种事。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"可你这么私自跑出来，不等于还是在为公司善后吗？","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"这......","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"......他们把断连期间的赔偿和各种责任都算在我头上，早点修好，我也少被他们讹点钱......","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#14$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"而且我、我做这些也不全是为了公司！我其实一直有个理想——","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"charslot","id":299},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$2","duration":"1","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"嘉辛塔、阿梅利亚？你们怎么还在这里？","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-17$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"这位是......罗德岛的干员？我是这里的负责人巴顿，出什么事了？","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2353_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$2","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"巴顿先生，井下出了问题，你们的一位员工，还有我们的朋友塔妮，都被困在巷道里了！","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-17$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":311},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":312},{"type":"charslot","id":313},{"type":"background","id":314},{"type":"image","id":315}],"characters":["塔妮","悠闲的矿工","安洁莉娜","太阳谷维修员","阿梅利亚","严肃的负责人","太阳谷联络员","嘉辛塔"]}